d":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","review_id":"MzpsKoU8AEJWZut-A1pWGw","date":"2018-12-14T19:23:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.930124044418335,"text_excerpt":"Great great place. It's spacious and quiet enough to work for hours with plenty of outlets and menu choices. They sell Valhrona chocolate which is awesome because that's a hard to find brand. The servers are very friendly and I was impressed with their soup of the day. The sandwiches look hefty and amazing, especially the caprese. They have wonderful choices of cream cheese: salmon, roasted veggie or lemon caper. I would definitely go back there to work and my only suggestion is that they add oat milk to their milk offerings."},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","review_id":"slxf6eNq6G-iDX33izamxg","date":"2019-08-04T17:38:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9195637702941895,"text_excerpt":"One of my newest work/dining venues! Gracious is spacious, clean, and has an outdoor patio as well. The selection of sweet and savory pastries is small but creative and quite tasty--even the sugar-glazed items, which I normally tend to avoid. Be sure to go on weekends when the baker often provides their unbelievable rugulach,which are some of the best I've ever had. But go early because I'm not ashamed of my greed and sometimes buy them all. Great sandwiches and some of the best cafe mocha in town!"},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","review_id":"SZnp4e1FR_KPHZwjhGvcfg","date":"2019-05-27T19:34:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9150014519691467,"text_excerpt":"Gracious offers delicious pastries, light breakfast and lunch options all in an ambient and modern setting. The menu has surprisingly dense diversity and many great options for people trying to be conscious of calories. If you're not however, the Almond Croissant and Gingersnap cookie are both great options. They serve French Truck coffee I believe, which is the absolute best coffee in the city. So you get lots of great things going on at Gracious. The only thing? It's a very quiet place. Music is always low and people aren't socializing much. Great for homework I suppose !"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","photo_id":"U-KXsdi1Rf-LtxuP9DYAuA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U-KXsdi1Rf-LtxuP9DYAuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8925454616546631},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","photo_id":"SJUMadGk9Ya-bIdnkAs_ZQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SJUMadGk9Ya-bIdnkAs_ZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8514595627784729},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","photo_id":"4WRxhGuUj0LYNsoJMVBEaw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4WRxhGuUj0LYNsoJMVBEaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8501391410827637},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","photo_id":"UCSZW64DJWKRRTC7uckj3g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UCSZW64DJWKRRTC7uckj3g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8447797298431396},{"business_id":"uUgRgEdYbp4IPOUK2j-60Q","photo_id":"2AgYgRp4F08mbHKuBYD_Tg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2AgYgRp4F08mbHKuBYD_Tg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8415721654891968}]},"notebook_case":null}
